        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Matte Black 36 Inch Square Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 3 Foot long square door handle can be surfaced mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on all door types. Very large 1-1/2\" Square grip gives this 36\" long pull a bold look. Made from Stainless Steel and finished in extra tough matte black powder coating. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-MSQP36-size.gif?v=1704354671\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-MSQP36-622 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/matte-black-42-inch-square-pull-dwd-msqp42-622\"><b>Black 42\" Square Door Pull</b></a>,\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD MSQP36-622  Black Square Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Total Length: 37-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 36\" </li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\" Square </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Tubular Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
